            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "Simulations are performed with the Climate System Model of the National Centre for Atmospheric Research (NCAR CSM1.4-carbon) (Doney et al. 2006; Fung et al. 2005; Fr\u00f6licher et al. 2009; Steinacher et al. 2009a). It is a fully coupled, global climate-carbon cycle model. Biogeochemistry is simulated with a modified version of the terrestrial biogeochemistry model CASA (Randerson et al. 1997) and a prognostic version (Doney et al. 2006) of the OCMIP-2 ocean biogeochemistry model (Najjar et al. 2007).",
